<title>USA: Jefferson County, Ala., okays bingo prize measure.</title>
<headline>Jefferson County, Ala., okays bingo prize measure.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferson County, Alabama, voters approved an amendment to establish by local law the monetary amount of prizes for playing bingo, an official at the County Probate Court said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Voters approved the measure with 109,743 &quot;yes&quot; votes, while 86,654 people voted against it, the official said.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
